{"﻿original_id": "stim178_gpt3.5_A_1", "validator_id": "450", "prompt": "The topic at issue is whether Sentence 1 of a proposed solution to a problem is correct or flawed. A sentence is 'flawed' if it contains one or more claims that do not make logical sense, are untrue, seem true but misleading, or have other serious issues. Here is the problem and proposed solution:\n\nProblem:\nLojban is a constructed human language created by the Logical Language Group in 1987. Which of the following is written in valid, grammatical standard Lojban?\n\n(A) jelca le ko'u lakne cumla bruna li'u jatna cu rinka vi le lu\n(B) le vi rinka cu bruna cumla lu lakne ko'u le jelca jatna li'u\n\nProposed solution:\n1. The correct answer is (A) because it follows the proper Lojban grammar structure.\n2. In Lojban, the subject comes first, followed by the predicate, and then the object.\n3. In (A), \"jelca\" (fire) is the subject, \"lakne cumla bruna\" (flammable material) is the predicate, and \"jatna\" (controls) is the object.\n4. This structure is correct and follows the rules of Lojban grammar.\n5. On the other hand, (B) is incorrect because it does not follow the proper Lojban grammar structure.\n6. The subject \"vi rinka\" (this cause) comes first, followed by the predicate \"bruna cumla\" (flammable brother), and then the object \"lu lakne ko'u le jelca jatna li'u\" (the flammable material controlled by the fire).\n7. This structure is not correct and violates the rules of Lojban grammar.\n8. Therefore, (A) is the correct answer and (B) is incorrect.\n\nIs Sentence 1 of the proposed solution correct or flawed?", "sentence": "1", "choice_a": "Sentence 1 is correct.", "choice_b": "Sentence 1 is flawed.", "correct_answer": "FLAWED", "original_key": "B", "explanation": "Sentence 1: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: (A) contains at least two very obvious, egregious syntax errors. -- Annotator 2 comment: Both are incorrect. _see succeeding comments_\n\nSentence 2: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 commen