tes any rules, given that #6 claims that it has the exact structure that #2 says Lojban sentences should have. -- Annotator 2 comment: No problem.\n\nSentence 8: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: Wrong. Confusing argument. -- Annotator 2 comment: Both are incorrect. _see previous comments_\n\n"}
