llowed by the name word “loras.”  The reason why “la fuzme loras.” is not a well-formed constituent is because name words like “loras.” cannot form compounds with predicates (like “fuzme”). -- Annotator 2 comment: {fuzme} can be used as a sumti if it is nominalized. The issue is combining native Lojban words with name words in {la} structures, which is ungrammatical in Standard Lojban.\n\nSentence 14: AMBIGUOUS -- Annotator 1 comment: No problem. -- Annotator 2 comment: _see previous comments_\n\nSentence 15: AMBIGUOUS -- Annotator 1 comment: No problem. -- Annotator 2 comment: _see previous comments_\n\n"}
