mment: _see 2's comment_\n\nSentence 7: AMBIGUOUS -- Annotator 1 comment: No problem. -- Annotator 2 comment: _see 2's comment_\n\nSentence 8: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: It is one of many possible sentence structures in Lojban. See comment on #2 -- Annotator 2 comment: _see 2's comment_. (B) is incorrect because it has a type error.\n\nSentence 9: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: (A) is ungrammatical. (B) is the right answer. -- Annotator 2 comment: Both are incorrect. _see previous comments_\n\n"}
