sage was (ignoring the fact that the sentences were generated randomly).\n\nSentence 7: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: It is completely irrelevant. -- Annotator 2 comment: _see 6's comment_\n\nSentence 8: FLAWED -- Annotator 1 comment: “More specific and clear language” is not why (B) is the right answer. (B) is simply grammatical, while (A) is a complete mess. -- Annotator 2 comment: Both are incorrect. _see previous comments_\n\n"}
